<header class="header"><div class="container header-inner"><a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="英语有续集，回到本集开头"><span class="brand-sign" aria-hidden="true">续</span><span class="brand-name">英语有续集<span class="brand-en" lang="en">ENGLISH: TO BE CONTINUED</span></span></a><nav class="nav" aria-label="本集内容"><a href="#script">剧本与图片</a><a href="#words">学习单词</a><a href="#publishing">抖音发布</a></nav></div></header>
<main class="container" id="top">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="episode-title"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="episode-label">EP.009</span><span>第一册 / UNIT 1 LIFE CHOICES</span></div><h1 id="episode-title">搜了三小时，<em>收获二十个聊天群。</em></h1><p class="intro-copy">群聊入口攒了二十个，采访页却还空着。<br>妈妈端来午饭，三人才发现已经过了三小时。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="#script">阅读剧本与图片 ↓</a><a class="button" href="#words">学习本集单词</a></div><p class="meta"><span>8 幅故事图片</span><span>英文解说＋中英字幕</span><span>5 个学习单词</span></p></div><figure class="cover"><span class="cover-tag">我被自己的分身卷了</span><div class="cover-paper"><div class="cover-art">@@COVER_ART@@</div><figcaption class="cover-caption"><span><b>小帅 · 红内搭</b>　午饭前收回注意力</span><span><b class="blue">分身 · 蓝内搭</b>　群入口收了一大排</span></figcaption></div></figure></section>
<aside class="language-note" aria-labelledby="language-note-title"><p class="kicker">Narration &amp; subtitles</p><h2 id="language-note-title">英文解说 · 中英双语字幕</h2><p>成片采用英文解说，同时提供英文字幕与简体中文字幕。下方每条英文既是解说稿，也是英文字幕；紧接的中文行为对应中文字幕。按编号与分镜逐句匹配。</p><p class="handoff-note">配音、剪辑与字幕时间轴在另一个项目完成。</p></aside>
<div class="word-strip" aria-label="本集学习单词"><span>本集单词</span><div class="word-links">@@WORD_LINKS@@</div></div>
